uupoll is used to create an empty work file for the specified system,so the system will be called next time the uucp queue is scanned forwork.  It should normally be used from cron to force periodic calls tosystems that do not call you when they have files ready to betransfered.Usage:uupoll [-gGRADE] SYSTEM [SYSTEM]...GRADE is a single character which is stored but currently ignored.SYSTEM is the system to call.